# Sounio Loom Multiplexer

Concept-ID: `SOUNIO-LOOM-MULTIPLEXER`

Status: executable for Loom-1.3 on one Unix host, including one-shot post-Pod
desired-state reconciliation, non-rolling Kubernetes activation, and a
source-tested Beagle supervisor compatibility bridge. This is a bounded systems
witness, not a novelty, priority, distributed-availability, deployed-Beagle, or
host-loss claim.

